<!-- Settings Modal -->
<div id="settings-modal">
  <div id="settings-box">
    <h2>⚙️ 设置</h2>
    
    <div class="settings-section">
      <h3>🔊 音效设置</h3>
      <div class="settings-item" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:6px;">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          <label>背景音乐</label>
          <span id="bgm-volume-val" style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;">80%</span>
        </div>
        <input type="range" id="bgm-volume" min="0" max="100" value="80" style="width:100%;accent-color:#60a5fa;" oninput="setBgmVolume(this.value)">
      </div>
      <div class="settings-item" style="flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:6px;margin-top:12px;">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">
          <label>出牌音效</label>
          <span id="sfx-volume-val" style="color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;">100%</span>
        </div>
        <input type="range" id="sfx-volume" min="0" max="100" value="100" style="width:100%;accent-color:#60a5fa;" oninput="setSfxVolume(this.value)">
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="settings-section">
      <h3>👤 账户信息</h3>
      <div class="user-info-panel" id="user-info-panel">
        <div class="avatar" id="user-avatar">👤</div>
        <div class="uname" id="user-name-display">游客</div>
        <div class="ustatus" id="user-status">未登录</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="settings-section" id="stats-section">
      <h3>📊 战绩统计</h3>
      <div id="stats-panel" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:8px 0;">
        <div style="text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#60a5fa;" id="stat-total">0</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">总场次</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#4ade80;" id="stat-wins">0</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">胜利</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#fbbf24;" id="stat-rate">0%</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">胜率</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border-radius:10px;padding:12px;">
          <div style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:#f87171;" id="stat-streak">0</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;">连胜</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="stats-login-hint" style="display:none;text-align:center;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;padding:10px;">登录后可查看战绩</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="settings-section" id="leaderboard-section">
      <h3>🏆 排行榜</h3>
      <div id="leaderboard-panel" style="max-height:200px;overflow-y:auto;">
        <div id="lb-empty" style="text-align:center;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px;padding:10px;">暂无数据</div>
        <table id="lb-table" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;display:none;">
          <thead><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
            <th style="text-align:left;padding:6px 8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;">排名</th>
            <th style="text-align:left;padding:6px 8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;">玩家</th>
            <th style="text-align:center;padding:6px 8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;">场次</th>
            <th style="text-align:center;padding:6px 8px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:12px;">胜率</th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="lb-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="settings-section">
      <h3>📖 游戏规则</h3>
      <div class="rules-content">
        <h4>基本规则</h4>
        <p>斗地主是一款三人扑克牌游戏，使用一副54张牌（含大小王）。</p>
        <p>每人发17张牌，留3张底牌给地主。</p>
        
        <h4>叫地主</h4>
        <p>玩家轮流选择是否叫地主（抢地主），叫地主的人拿到底牌后成为地主。</p>
        <p>地主1人对抗另外2个农民。</p>
        
        <h4>出牌规则</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><b>单张</b>：任意一张牌</li>
          <li><b>对子</b>：两张同点数的牌</li>
          <li><b>三条</b>：三张同点数的牌</li>
          <li><b>三带一</b>：三条+一张单牌</li>
          <li><b>三带二</b>：三条+一对</li>
          <li><b>顺子</b>：5张或更多连续单牌（3-A，不含2和王）</li>
          <li><b>连对</b>：3对或更多连续对子</li>
          <li><b>飞机</b>：2组或更多连续三条</li>
          <li><b>炸弹</b>：4张同点数的牌（可炸任何牌）</li>
          <li><b>火箭</b>：大小王（最大的牌，可炸任何牌）</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h4>胜负判定</h4>
        <p>地主先把牌出完则地主赢，任一农民先出完则农民赢。</p>
        <p>炸弹和火箭会翻倍计分。</p>
        
        <h4>计分规则</h4>
        <p>基础分3分，每出一个炸弹/火箭翻一倍。</p>
        <p>地主赢：两个农民各输基础分；地主赢2倍基础分。</p>
        <p>农民赢：地主输2倍基础分；两个农民各赢基础分。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <button class="settings-btn settings-btn-secondary" onclick="closeSettings()">关闭设置</button>
    <button class="settings-btn settings-btn-secondary" onclick="goToLobby()" style="margin-top:8px;">🏠 返回大厅</button>
